<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-2.8pt;"><img src="2509.16149v1/figures/logo.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:48/48;" width="48" height="48" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>Pointing to a Llama and Call it a Camel 
<br class="ltx_break">On the Sycophancy of Multimodal Large Language Models
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Renjie Pi
</span><span id="id2" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_contribution ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span>  Equal Contribution.
</span></span></span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
